	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/plain" rect="(242.0, 17.0, 150.0, 60.0)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="12">We imputed the missing values to be able to visualize all the data points.</text>
		<text id="1" type="text/plain" rect="(311.0, 292.0, 218.0, 61.0)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="12">Scatter plot with most informative features. Do they provide a good separation of classes? Open the widget to check this out.</text>
